<BaseLayout title="Clickerty" author="Clickerty", description="Clickerty's personal website.">
    <div style="display: flex; text-align: center; justify-content: space-evenly; align-items: center; width: 340px;">
        <h1>Hi! I'm Clickerty, and I make things online.</h1>
        <img src="/introductory.png" width="140" height="140" title="A drawing of Clickerty (me) with an arrow pointing to me with the text \'that' me\' made in MS Paint. The drawing is horribly jumbled up." alt="A drawing of Clickerty (me) with an arrow pointing to me with the text \'that' me\' made in MS Paint. The drawing is horribly jumbled up.">
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; text-align: center; justify-content: center; align-items: center; width: 340px;">
        <h2><a href="/about">ABOUT</a></h2>
        <h2 style="padding: 0 15px;">/</h2>
        <h2><a href="/blog">BLOG</a></h2>
    </div>
    <p>Uh... Well, I don't really have any big projects to show off at the moment, so...</p>
    <img src="/uuhhh.png" height="132" width="340">
    <p>Come back later, I guess. The website is still a work in progress, anyways.</p>
    <p>In the meantime...</p>
    <p>You can find me on all these socials (which are also listed in the footer of every webpage):</p>
