        <a href="https://x.com/clickerty3"><button class="button" style="min-width:90px;">Twitter (not X)</button></a>
        <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/clickerty.bsky.social"><button class="button" style="min-width:90px;">Bluesky</button></a>
        <a href="https://tumblr.com/clickerty"><button class="button" style="min-width:90px;">Tumblr</button></a>
        <a href="https://clickerty.newgrounds.com"><button class="button" style="min-width:90px;">Newgrounds</button></a>
    </div>
    <p>I am also part of an indie development studio called αlpha.zero which you can check out here:</p>
    <a href="https://alphazero-official.github.io"><button class="button" style="min-width:90px;"><img src="/alphazero.svg" width="30" height="30"></button></a>
